    /// — vacuously `false` on every diff.** The strict interior
    /// carries witnesses only on axes with
    /// `axis_cardinality::<A>() >= 4` (the strict interval
    /// `[2, cardinality - 2]` is empty on cardinality `0`, `1`, `2`,
