        // (soc, product) surface factorization: `sofsp == soc² -
        // 2·product³` on every fixture — the sum-of-two-cubes-squared
        // identity `p⁶ + t⁶ = (p³ + t³)² - 2·(pt)³`. Non-negative
        // subtraction since `(p³+t³)² = p⁶ + 2p³t³ + t⁶` so LHS - RHS =
