        // joint quartic magnitude is at least `2` because both fourth-
        // powered endpoints are structurally `>= 1` on every non-empty
        // map (by `peak_source_kind_count >= 1` and
        // `trough_source_kind_count >= 1` on the non-empty case), and
        // their sum-of-fourth-powers is at least `1 + 1 == 2`. Source-
